---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Learn how your data is collected, stored and protected. A clear, transparent privacy policy outlining how your information is handled when using this website."
    />
  </Fragment>

  <Hero
    title="Privacy Policy"
    subtitle="How your information is collected and used"
  />

  <section class="w-full bg-bgsecondary py-20">
    <div class="content-container py-10">
      <h2 class="text-4xl text-secondary py-10 text-center">
        We take your privacy seriously...
      </h2>

      <div class="max-w-prose mx-auto text-secondary leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>
          This website collects personal information only when a visitor chooses
          to submit it through the contact form. This typically includes a name,
          an email address, and the message provided.
        </p>

        <p>
          The information is used solely to respond to the enquiry. It is not
          shared with third parties, and the website does not use analytics
          tools, tracking scripts, advertising cookies, or behavioural profiling
          technologies.
        </p>

        <p>
          All information is stored securely and retained only for as long as
          necessary to respond to the message. Visitors may request the removal
          of their details at any time by contacting the site owner directly.
        </p>

        <p>
          This website operates in accordance with UK GDPR and EU GDPR
          requirements. The policy is reviewed and updated whenever data
          practices change.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
